K I L L E R S   C O M M A N D E R   ::   K K C       

[Ploum](gemini://ploum.net)

## Introduction

### Features

KKC (Ketchup Killers Commander) is a dual-panel terminal file manager
written in Rust, inspired by the classic Norton Commander interface.

Key features:

- Dual-panel browsing with tab support in each panel
- Internal file viewer: Text, Hex, ANSI and Image modes
- [File search](#search-files) by name and content
- [Copy](#copy-file), [Move](#move-file), [Delete](#delete-file), [Mkdir](#create-directory), [Rename](#rename-file)
- [Wildcard selection](#select-files-by-pattern) with pattern matching
- [Directory bookmarks](#directory-bookmarks) for quick navigation
- [Remote browsing](#remote-browsing-sftp--imap) via SFTP and IMAP
- [Built-in archive browsing](#archive-browsing) (ZIP and more)
- [Lua plugin system](#plugins-lua-system) for custom viewers and file handlers
- [File associations](#file-associations) to launch any external program
- Hundreds of color themes
- Configurable via [Options > Setup](#configuration-options--setup)

---

