## Keyboard Reference

### Function Keys (Panel)

| Shortcut | Description |
| --- | --- |
| F1 | Display this [Help](#help). |
| F2 | Open [Menu bar](#menu-bar). |
| F3 | [View file](#view-file) (internal viewer). |
| F4 | [Edit file](#edit-file) with configured or internal editor. |
| F5 | [Copy](#copy-file) selected files to other panel. |
| F6 | [Move](#move-file) selected files to other panel. |
| F7 | [Create directory](#create-directory). |
| F8 | [Delete](#delete-file) selected files. |
| F10 | [Quit](#quit). |

### Navigation

| Shortcut | Description |
| --- | --- |
| UP / DOWN | Move cursor up / down. |
| PGUP / PGDN | Move one page up / down. |
| HOME | Jump to first entry. |
| END | Jump to last entry. |
| TAB | Switch active panel. |
| ENTER | Enter directory or open file. |
| BACKSPACE | Go to parent directory. |

### Selection

| Shortcut | Description |
| --- | --- |
| INS | Select / deselect current file. |
| SPACE | Select / deselect and move down. |
| + | [Select by wildcard pattern](#select-files-by-pattern). |
| - | [Deselect by wildcard pattern](#deselect-files-by-pattern). |
| * | [Invert selection](#invert-selection). |

